[03] COMPLETE BACKUPS WITH RECEIPTS AND PHOTOS
Status: Implemented; new Swift regression test supplied but not run here.

- Added Tender/Core/Backup.swift.
- Added a versioned TenderBackup archive containing the ledger plus actual
